# 2026-09-09 — harden binary integrity after the corrupted ffmpeg bundle
# incident (damaged PE headers were committed and every checkout/build then
# deployed a broken FFmpeg\ffmpeg.exe -> silent record failure).
# Mark all binary formats explicitly so no EOL conversion or diff machinery
# ever touches them on any platform/checkout.
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.pdb   binary
*.bin   binary
